      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "Rocket Lab hardware featured in @NASA’s Image of the Day.\n\nOur Albuquerque team manufactured the PVA panels that were populated with our high-efficiency, quad-junction Z4J+ solar cells that were integrated onto NASA NEO Surveyor’s 20-ft long sunshade structure.\n\nThe array delivers up to 2 kW and is the spacecraft's only power source as it hunts hazardous asteroids and comets.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "NASASolarSystem",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1852211324224442369/9KHp7JLo_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-27 03:50:27",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-26T19:50:27.000Z",
        "id": "2114806886424076661",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlMsylboAA6fx8.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "height": 1365,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlMsylboAA6fx8.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 2048
          }
        ],
        "name": "NASA Solar System",
        "text": "The sunshade for the NEO Surveyor mission is ready for its day in the sun! 😎\n\nNASA's Near-Earth Object (NEO) Surveyor will hunt for potentially hazardous asteroids and comets that cross Earth’s path.  ½",
        "url": "https://x.com/NASASolarSystem/status/2114806886424076661",
