      "text": "Make parts that go to space 🚀\n \nWe’re hiring CNC Operators and Programmers in Auckland, New Zealand, and Long Beach, CA.\n \nBe part of the high performance team bringing designs for spacecraft and rockets to life using advanced manufacturing technology.",
