      "author_verified_type": "organization",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-10-27T20:36:17.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-28 04:36:17",
      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "Members of @SemperCitiusSDA's Tranche 2 leadership team were recently at Rocket Lab's California headquarters to see T2TL-Beta in production.\n\nEight of 18 spacecraft are on the floor right now, in build.\n\nSolar panels, structures, star trackers, reaction wheels, radios, flight software, avionics, launch dispenser — all built in-house.\n\nProliferated architectures demand production at scale. Rocket Lab is all in on SDA's mission, and the action on our floor proves it. We're proud to be delivering this.",
